1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.290
<v A>A few broad observations, and things worth arguing about.

2
00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:25.090
<v A>Market education is an expensive strategy. Where demand exists, concentrate on it and find a focused way to meet it.

3
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:41.890
<v A>Long-tail organic traffic takes a lot of time and a lot of newly created content. It is not a shortcut.

4
00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:58.690
<v A>Competing against major players, monopolies or dominant players is hard. Think partnerships, a different business model, or a large budget.

5
00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:09.020
<v A>Viral marketing and social networks are not stable or predictable business models.

6
00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:15.290
<v B>Is virality really not a business model?

7
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:21.560
<v A>Spread the investment across several marketing channels.

8
00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:37.550
<v A>Build continuing synergy between the channels: social sharing helps SEO, organic optimisation helps paid keyword conversion, and so on.

9
00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:53.540
<v A>It is difficult to get results if the website or the online activity does not have a clear purpose.

10
00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:59.000
<v A>Next module you build that website.
